<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Mar 13 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Mar 13 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $1.131 trillion in the week to March 13 from $1.129 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     65.93		53.36</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     28.01		28.68</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 1065.90	    1075.81</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    272.06	     281.72</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	855.04	     824.65</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    276.79	     304.52</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
